    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken in a stunning world, seeking to unravel mysteries through puzzles that reveal hidden details of your surroundings. Along the way, meet unique, animal-like characters, each with their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.poster.avif?t=1733930489\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.webm?t=1733930489\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3318830/extras/9e3e7524dcdfbc42e0dde19e3bd1adf7.mp4?t=1733930489\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles using magitech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore breathtaking environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with intriguing NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the secret of Honu</p></li></ul>",
